            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1003-f2" n="7" xml:id="d1003-f2-content">
                <p>As Department’s No. 580, November 26, 8 p.m., with instructions to clarify and
                    report on “the course of events with the customs matter.”</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
